<article class="prose">
  <h1>Lava</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    Lava is a desktop environment for Linux: a Wayland compositor, the shell
    around it, and the everyday applications, all written with one UI
    framework of its own, LavaUI. The framework is declarative Swift, shaped
    like SwiftUI, and it is documented here.
  </p>
</article>

